text = "[color=#0f0][color=#f00]The population currently uses half a dozen forms of currency.[color=#0f0]


We will set the [i]Avantist   Bull[/i] as a shared standard. This will facilitate simple models of taxation, enable smooth economic integration with the wider Carcasse, and ensure the satrapy is awash with ammunition. 

[color=#7f7][i][font_size=22]... each Bull being an intermediate cartridge bullet, of course.[/font_size][/i][color=#0f0]



First, you must decide how this policy will be implemented..."
autowrap_mode = 2
